@endpoint = http://localhost:3000/api/players

### Get all players
GET http://localhost:3000/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create a new player
POST http://localhost:3000/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Player",
  "position": "Forward",
  "age": 36
}

###

### Create another player
POST http://localhost:3000/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Virgil van Dijk",
  "position": "Defender",
  "age": 32
}

###

### Create a goalkeeper
POST http://localhost:3000/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alisson Becker",
  "position": "Goalkeeper",
  "age": 30
}

###

### Get a specific player by ID (replace with actual ObjectId from create response)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/players/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Update a player (replace with actual ObjectId)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/players/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lionel Messi Jr.",
  "age": 37
}

###

### Delete a player (replace with actual ObjectId)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/players/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test creating player with team_id (optional field)
POST {{endpoint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cristiano Ronaldo",
  "position": "Forward",
  "age": 39,
  "team_id": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011"
}

###

### ===== ERROR SCENARIO TESTS =====

### 2. POST request which fails validation - Invalid position
POST http://localhost:3000/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Player",
  "position": "InvalidPosition",
  "age": 25
}

###

### POST request which fails validation - Age too young
POST http://localhost:3000/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Player",
  "position": "Forward",
  "age": 15
}

###

### POST request which fails validation - Missing required fields
POST http://localhost:3000/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Player"
}

###

### 5. GET request on an individual resource which fails (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/players/507f1f77bcf86cd799439999

###

### 7. DELETE request on an individual resource which fails (404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/players/507f1f77bcf86cd799439999

###

### 9. PUT request on an individual resource which fails as the resource cannot be found (404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/players/507f1f77bcf86cd799439999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Player Name"
}

###

### 10. PUT request on an individual resource which fails as the data is not valid
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/players/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "position": "InvalidPosition"
}

###

### PUT request validation failure - Invalid age
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/players/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 10
}